# OpenReceptionist – Master Project Summary

**Project:** AI-Powered Real-Time Receptionist\
**Hardware:** NVIDIA DGX Spark\
**Primary goal:** Build an intelligent AI receptionist that can answer phone calls, understand callers, have natural conversations, and handle receptionist tasks.

## 1\. Our technology stack

These are the technologies we've agreed to use.

| Component | Technology | Purpose |
| --- | --- | --- |
| AI Brain | Qwen 3.8 – 35B | Reasoning, understanding, conversation management |
| Speech-to-Text | Qwen3 STT | Recognizes what callers say |
| Text-to-Speech | Fish Audio Drama 3 | Generates natural receptionist speech |
| Real-time infrastructure | LiveKit | Manages audio, calls, and conversations |
| Hardware | NVIDIA DGX Spark | Runs the AI models locally |

**Important:** We are not using Chatterbox, Whisper, or other experimental TTS models. Our focus is the agreed stack above.

